OL,3,GNEWSAStray cat numbers three times
OL,4,Ahigher in one town
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of Luton have three times the
OL,7,Fnumber of stray cats compared with the
OL,8,Fnational picture, according to a rescue
OL,9,Fcharity.
OL,11,FCats Protection is on a mission to trap
OL,12,Fthe stray colonies, neuter those who
OL,13,Fare old enough, and then release them.
OL,15,FLee Gilheany-Pockett, a community
OL,16,Fadviser at the charity, said that his
OL,17,Fteam and volunteers from other groups
OL,18,Fwere "tackling" the problem.
OL,20,FWithin the last two years he said they
OL,21,Fhad neutered more than 1,000 cats,
OL,22,Fincluding some which were domesticated.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
